==Finnish==

===Etymology===
Ultimately from {{der|fi|grc|Πέτρος}}. 
* ''St Petersburg'': In Finnish towns named after individuals are often left as is. Compare {{m|fi|Mikkeli}}, {{m|fi|Antrea}} and {{m|fi|Loviisa}}.

