====Usage notes====
The given name {{m|fi|Pekka}} is regarded in some sources as being derived from Peter the apostle, but it would seem more plausible that {{m|fi||Pekka}} more directly comes from {{m|fi|Pekko}}, the ancient Finnish god of cultivation.

